\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute $\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}.$ Computing the mean of the squares of the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot ({3}^{2}+{18}^{2}+{11}^{2}+{8}^{2}+{7}^{2}+{18}^{2}+{12}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot (9+324+121+64+49+324+144) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot 1035 \\\\  & =\\frac{1035}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }^{2} & =\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-(\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1035}{7}-{(11)}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1035}{7}-121 \\\\  & =\\frac{1035-847}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{188}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186119882 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292931 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186119883 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292930 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186124519 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292881 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129108 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292614 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129108 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292622 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129207 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292907 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129207 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292908 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129292 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292554 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129292 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292555 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129292 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292562 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129293 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292549 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129293 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292563 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129293 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292564 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129293 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292566 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129294 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292556 13194139533409 17592186045585 true] [17592186129294 1038 #edb/ref 17592186292557 1319413953